{"id":"4bf0b109a78ca196","group":"14","path":"14/14-df-cartesian-closed-category.md","title":"Definition — Cartesian Closed Category","display":"Definition — Cartesian Closed Category","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane & Moerdijk)","book_abbrev":"14","label":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category","aliases":["14-df-cartesian-closed-category"],"display":"Definition — Cartesian Closed Category","depends_on":["[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","[[14-df-exponentials]]"],"source_status":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Sheaves in Geometry and Logic (Mac Lane &amp; Moerdijk)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"14"},{"key":"label","html":"14-df-cartesian-closed-category"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>14-df-cartesian-closed-category</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"Definition — Cartesian Closed Category"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"来源定位沿用附件笔记；本次未重新核验原书文件。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 为候选范畴。终对象、积的普遍性质见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1044b7940aaa4f1f\" href=\"?note=1044b7940aaa4f1f\" title=\"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products\">14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C)\">\\(\\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" href=\"?note=4fc4fd1ccffdbab5\" title=\"14-df-exponentials\">14-df-exponentials</a>，其参数同时包含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\">\\(E\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 的积数据，因而无需预先假定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal C\">\\(\\mathcal C\\)</span> 已有一组指定的积。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsProduct}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists E,P,p,q,e\\ \\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsProduct}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,A,B)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists E,P,p,q,e\\ \\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书定位：I.6 Exponentials；IV.1 Definition of a Topos。先给积和指数的可检验普遍性质，再定义笛卡儿闭性；不再在公式中使用尚未选择的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\times B\">\\(E\\times B\\)</span> 或未定义的箭头积。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[14-df-exponentials]]","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products","status":"resolved","id":"1044b7940aaa4f1f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为候选范畴。终对象、积的普遍性质见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]；$\\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C)$ 见 [[14-df-exponentials]]，其参数同时包含 $E$ 与 $B$ 的积数据，因而无需预先假定 $\\mathcal C$ 已有一组指定的积。","embed":false},{"target":"14-df-exponentials","status":"resolved","id":"4fc4fd1ccffdbab5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathcal C$ 为候选范畴。终对象、积的普遍性质见 [[14-df-terminal-initial-objects-products]]；$\\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C)$ 见 [[14-df-exponentials]]，其参数同时包含 $E$ 与 $B$ 的积数据，因而无需预先假定 $\\mathcal C$ 已有一组指定的积。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C)","display":false},{"tex":"E","display":false},{"tex":"B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal C","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}(\\mathcal C)\\leftrightarrow{}&\\mathrm{IsCategory}(\\mathcal C)\\land\\exists T\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\mathrm{IsTerminal}_{\\mathcal C}(T)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall A,B\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists P,p,q\\ \\mathrm{IsProduct}_{\\mathcal C}(P,p,q,A,B)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall B,C\\in\\mathrm{Ob}(\\mathcal C)\\ \\exists E,P,p,q,e\\ \\mathrm{IsExponentialDatum}_{\\mathcal C}(E,P,p,q,e,B,C).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E\\times B","display":false}],"bytes":1464,"backlinks":[{"id":"c53146be63465990","anchor":"ref-16","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category|Definition — Cartesian Closed Category]]"},{"id":"4e6c05c92e3b9bf9","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IsCartesianClosed}$ (Cartesian-closed predicate, see [[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]])"},{"id":"4741fef73eb1a614","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]"},{"id":"7df95b777d9b2ddd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定满足 [[14-df-exponentials]] 的 $\\mathrm{IsExponentialFamily}_{\\mathcal E}(Q,\\varepsilon)$ 的指数选择，采用其 $B^A$ 与求值记号；[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]] 保证该选择可作出。下列符号分别是对象层与集合层的三个运算。"},{"id":"ffda0c0482667c45","anchor":"ref-10","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category]]"},{"id":"c60ad289d123497b","anchor":"ref-17","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[14-df-cartesian-closed-category|Definition — Cartesian Closed Category]]"},{"id":"c2459b62252fa306","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"4fb22144b0e10ac9","anchor":"ref-2","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9b47287c9839ebc7","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"eeaa128b028a8273","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"2f47f9749d4510aa","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""}],"outgoing":["1044b7940aaa4f1f","4fc4fd1ccffdbab5"]}